# RS-READ-04 shrink-only allowlist: files over 700 shipped lines when the rule landed, each capped
# at its length then (`<shipped lines> <path>`). An entry may only go down: repo-lint fails when a
# file grows past its entry, when an entry is new or raised against the base revision, and when a
# file shrank without its entry following (`cargo run -p repo-lint -- --shrink-allowlist`).
# A file back within 700 lines leaves the list. Never add a line here: split the file instead.
# A file moved with `git mv` keeps its cap under the new path (RL002 follows git's rename).
907 crates/cv-pr-diff/src/diff_view.rs
965 crates/cv-pr-rendered/src/markdown_diff.rs
746 crates/cv-pr-files/src/lib.rs
837 crates/cv-pr-summary/src/lib.rs
704 crates/cv-pr-pipelines/src/lib.rs
820 crates/cv-markdown/src/render.rs
